        "assets": [],
        "tarball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kanboard/kanboard/tarball/v1.2.55",
        "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/kanboard/kanboard/zipball/v1.2.55",
        "body": "### Security fixes\r\n\r\n- Prevent spoofed client IP addresses in trusted-proxy headers from bypassing IP-based CAPTCHA and login lockouts\r\n- Restrict dashboard and overdue-task queries to projects a user can still access\r\n- Enforce project authorization when closing board columns, reordering subtasks, and duplicating tasks between projects\r\n- Require the project-manager role to modify project metadata through the API\r\n- Validate and escape color IDs and project names to prevent cross-site scripting\r\n- Limit iCalendar start-date fields to supported task columns\r\n\r\n### Improvements\r\n\r\n- Add support for uploading and previewing WebP image attachments\r\n- Allow API clients to set a validated project member as the creator of task and project attachments\r\n- Add Azerbaijani interface translations and improve Swedish translations\r\n\r\n### Bug fixes\r\n\r\n- Preserve session cookies when Kanboard is installed in a subdirectory\r\n- Enable notifications for automatically created LDAP users when notifications are enabled by default\r\n- Return a complete JSON-RPC batch response when an individual request is forbidden\r\n\r\n### Maintenance\r\n\r\n- Harden GitHub Actions workflows with read-only job tokens and without persisted checkout credentials\r\n\r\n### Dependencies and build\r\n\r\n- Update several GitHub Actions dependencies",
