          "message": "build(docker): upgrade PHP to 8.5\n\nUpgrade the Docker image and runtime configuration from PHP 8.4 to PHP 8.5.\n\nThe current Alpine package resolves to PHP 8.5.12, which fixes CVE-2026-109618 and CVE-2026-109619.\n\nSee: https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-10-21-5",
